  "body": "Looking for a stylish, brand-new home without the hassle of ongoing maintenance? This beautifully designed three-bedroom home in Strathmill, Orewa, offers the perfect combination of modern comfort, practical living and an easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated 178m² (more or less) section, this home makes a striking first impression with its contemporary dark brick and weatherboard exterior, distinctive roofline and modern street appeal.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a bright and welcoming open-plan living space, where two skylights above the kitchen fill the heart of the home with natural light. The stylish kitchen features quality appliances, sleek cabinetry and warm timber-look finishes, creating a space that's both functional and inviting.\r\n\r\nSliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom open directly onto a private deck, offering a lovely setting for morning coffee, summer BBQs or simply relaxing outdoors. With minimal upkeep required, you'll have more time to enjoy the lifestyle you love.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed with three comfortable bedrooms, two modern bathrooms and a separate laundry, this home is an excellent choice for first-home buyers, downsizers, busy professionals or investors.\r\n\r\nFeatures You Will Love:\r\n\r\n•  3 bedrooms and 2 stylish bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n•  Contemporary dark brick and weatherboard exterior with modern street appeal\r\n•  Elevated 178m² (more or less) easy-care section\r\n•  Two kitchen skylights bringing in beautiful natural light\r\n•  Modern kitchen with quality appliances, sleek cabinetry and practical storage\r\n•  Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Sliding doors from both the living area and master bedroom onto the private deck\r\n•  Heat pump for year-round comfort\r\n•  Separate laundry for added everyday convenience\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for peace of mind\r\n•  Low-maintenance design, ideal for a lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n\r\nLocated in the growing Strathmill community, this home is just around the corner from a local reserve, with Orewa Beach, schools, shops, parks and cafés all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nWhether you're purchasing your first home, simplifying your lifestyle or adding to your investment portfolio, this is an opportunity to enjoy modern living in a fantastic coastal location.\r\n\r\nOne Community. Multiple Homes. One Easy Tour!\r\n\r\nWhy visit one home when you can explore several?\r\n\r\nWe have a great selection of brand-new homes throughout Strathmill, offering different layouts, sizes and features to suit your lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nCall Brianna and Brian to book your personalised Strathmill Home Tour – compare multiple homes in one convenient visit!\r\n\r\nViewing Directions: Via Flavell Road, or GPS to 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa. Follow the Strathmill signs.",
